    "id": "rna_column_purification_v1_renamed",
    "name": "pipette_p1000",
    "output": "outputs/rna_column_purification",
    "limitations": [
      "Declarative spin-column proxy, not rotor or membrane fluid physics: bulk drainage is ideal, and membrane binding, washing, residual state and elution parameters are uncalibrated benchmark assumptions in protocols.json. Product validity means the declared proxy criteria hold, not measured RNA purity or yield.",
      "Cell Lysis terminal composition and protocol-inactivated sample portions are an explicit declared state handoff, not evidence of an upstream execution. No additional 740 uL source reserve is used.",
      "Dynamic column mount uses the enabled closure joint parent and assembly pose readback. The existing open_lid/close_lid path sets the column on its rest between tubes. Tubes remain latched at declared seats; no physical rack or rotor dynamics are modeled.",
      "The device program is an authored setting, not measured RCF or temperature; physical intervals and an explicit accelerated experimental clock mapping support completed runs. AW1/AW2/AVE hazard formulations remain unknown pending verified SDS information.",
      "Elution uses a fresh P1000 tip instead of the spec's P200: the validated bench layout has room for one instrument. Geometry, tool paths and the 83 operations are inherited from PR #29; changed liquid-level paths need new Isaac validation."
    ]
  },
